WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.810
<i>Stare...</i>

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.770
And up you go.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.830
So you always carry her around that way.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:10.530
That's right!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.440
If we waited for her to get to 
the cooking room on her own,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.980
we'd be there until sundown.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.440
Aw, so you spoil her.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.660
You're one to talk!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:19.910
Okay, then...

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.800
Carry me, too!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.090
No! Get down!

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.570
It's fine! Don't be stingy!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.750
Everyone off!

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.630
You two can carry the sloth.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.480
Hey, are you a fan of mine?

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.600
Thanks! Keep supporting me, okay?

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.140
Eh?! What are you doing?!

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.570
H-Huh?!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.950
She's dead!

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:14.940
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.940
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:36.570
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:46.580
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.750
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.920
That scared me!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.990
<b>Seton Academy Record 9      Legends of Animal Ecology</b>

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.130
She just started bashing her 
head on the wall and died!

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.910
That's a tarsier for you.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.180
Tarsier?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:44.070
<i>A small primate that lives in Southeast Asia.</i>

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:47.020
<i>It is very delicate, and when it feels stress...</i>

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.900
It's a primate that commits suicide 
by bashing its head against trees.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.070
Suicide?!

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.570
But I didn't say anything 
to cause her any stress.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:59.030
Your presence itself is overbearing 
enough to cause stress!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.700
<b>Existence Causes Stress</b>

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.700
That's so mean!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.710
<i>So overbearing that I cause stress?</i>

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.530
<i>He didn't have to make me 
sound like the bad guy.</i>

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.090
Are you sitting out, too, Miyubi?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.590
Because you'll die?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.680
Yeah. What about you?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.180
Me?

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.700
I just hate tiring myself out.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.630
I don't get what's fun about that at all.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.650
I'd like...

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:39.530
to run with everyone, someday.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:42.500
Okay, then!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.410
Let's run now!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.460
One, two... One, two...

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.410
One, two... One, two...

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:53.790
One, two... One, two...

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.430
That's...

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:00.300
Your presence itself causes stress!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.680
Fine!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.930
N-Ni hao.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.180
Wait!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.520
Don't be scared. I won't do anything to you.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.140
You were watching me from 
the shadows yesterday, too.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:18.290
Are you a fan of mine?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.580
I knew it! Well, don't just 
stand around here, then!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.570
Let's chat!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.180
What's wrong?

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:35.980
She flew!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:42.090
<i>Tarsiers can jump roughly 
25 times their own body length.</i>

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.590
Sh-She's an incredible jumper...

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.600
Wait!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.990
Why?!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:57.700
Maybe she was so happy you talked 
to her that it stressed her out.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:58.550
What?!

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:01.350
What's that even mean? 
It's totally not my fault, then!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.670
She went off and died on her own!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:09.210
I always die even when I don't want to,

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:12.490
so I understand how she feels.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:15.160
Can't you do something for her, then?

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:21.050
But I'd die before I could 
do anything for her.

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.510
Well, then, I'll help you!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.450
Huh?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.040
Let's make friends with her together!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.850
We'll come up with a way to do it 
so that you don't have to die!

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.640
Meimei-chan...

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.610
I'm gonna be her friend without letting her die

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.530
and get back at Jin, no matter what!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.280
<i>Taking extreme caution,</i>

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.300
<i>Meimei attempted to get closer to Manako.</i>

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.490
<b>The World's Super Idol, Meimei 
The Long-Awaited First Photo Book</b>

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.560
<b>8x Speed</b>

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:56.500
<i>With Miyubi's help,</i>

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.250
<i>she gradually closed the 
distance between them...</i>

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:09.860
<i>and a definite bond began to 
grow between the three of them.</i>

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.560
<b>Conquer Instincts!!</b>

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.330
<b>Conquer Instincts!!</b>

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.970
<i>Then, at last...</i>

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.230
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:24.230
Let me introduce you.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.250
This is Kagami Manako-chan, 
the tarsier.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.570
She's my and Miyubi's friend.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.170
And who are <i>you</i>?!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.780
Well, she said seeing my face

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:36.500
makes her so happy that she 
gets stressed out and dies.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.330
Hey, Manako, do you—

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.200
Don't talk to her!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:40.620
Huh?!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:45.340
Just calm down! It's okay!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.710
She won't do anything to you!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:50.840
Jeez! Manako dies when strangers 
talk to her, you know!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.580
So don't make eye contact with her!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.470
Why did you bring someone 
like that here?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:00.020
You get it now, don't you? She...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.230
didn't die because I was overbearing 
and stressed her out!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.330
Did you bring her here just 
so you could say that?!

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.290
No.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:07.940
Huh?

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.530
I wanted to show off my 
new friend to all of you.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.740
Manako's really tough.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.050
She instinctively dies all the time,

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:19.120
but she still comes to see me again.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:23.590
I want all of you to know 
about my friend Manako!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:28.240
Of course! You're welcome here, Manako-chan!

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.630
Tell her that, okay?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.690
We're glad to have you!

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.310
Tell her that, please.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.640
I'm gonna lick her!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.630
Don't! She'll die!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:39.350
E-Everyone...

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.520
Thank you.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:47.010
There's nothing special about me,

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:51.030
but you're all saying such nice things to me.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.610
I'm...

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.530
so happy that I wouldn't mind if I died.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:58.910
Manako...

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.960
<b>Instinct</b>

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.840
You're actually gonna die?!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:03.960
Are you kidding me?!

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.380
Miyubi!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.320
You...

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.440
You slapped me...

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.500
Huh?!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.240
That was a slap?

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.870
Don't... die!

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:41.670
Don't let your instincts beat you!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.000
O-Okay...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.380
Miyubi!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.050
Manako!

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:57.300
Oh, no! She died!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.050
Would you take a hint already?!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.390
Aiya!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:11.480
I, um... apologize for getting aroused before.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.910
Yeah... It's okay.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:19.300
A-Anyway, it appears a typhoon is approaching.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.450
We must be careful.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.830
A typhoon's here, too...

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.670
Huh? A typhoon... "too"?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.170
I'm...

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:37.680
in heat now.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:41.660
Sorry, Kin-kun.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:45.180
With the typhoon coming, 
this really isn't the time, is it?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.350
It's all right.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.610
It won't take long.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:54.130
<i>A lion's copulation lasts 
about twenty seconds.</i>

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.360
Ah, w-wait...

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.370
<i>But they repeat the process for about a week,</i>

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>sometimes copulating fifty 
times in a single day, meaning...</i>

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.290
W-Wait!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.420
It won't last long!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.170
<i>It does last long!</i>

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.170
It's not that!

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:13.250
First... I want you to meet my parents.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.990
I shall!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.710
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:20.010
<i>Rabbit!</i>

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.570
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:25.020
<i>Sumatran elephant!</i>

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.020
It's really coming down.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:37.040
<i>The unseasonal typhoon currently 
ravaging the Cycomi region</i>

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:41.490
<b>Cycomi Regional Weather</b>

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:41.170
<i>is maintaining its strength as it 
travels northeast at 20 kilometers per hour.</i>

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:46.700
<i>Those who live near mountains or rivers 
should watch for evacuation notices...</i>

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.370
Bring more buckets!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.700
President, we should take 
shelter above ground for now!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.490
President!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.210
President?

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:57.550
Should I step down as 
student council president?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.050
What?!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:02.910
What are you saying?! 
There's no one but you who—

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.310
Oh, the power went out?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.110
Protect the president!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.750
That was scary, huh, Mana...

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:26.570
ko?!

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:27.530
Who are you?!

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:29.870
I'm... Manako.

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:34.750
<i>A tarsier's pupils grow 
extremely large in the dark.</i>

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:41.510
Due to the typhoon, the student council 
and underground dorms have been flooded.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:47.390
So those of you living in aboveground 
dorms will be sharing your rooms.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.430
I refuse! Just send them home!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.480
Oh?

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:55.540
Would you prefer to be skewered?

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:04.610
He's even grumpier than usual.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.370
Yeah, after suddenly being told 
he has to share his room...

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.440
It's just for a little while.
 I bet it'll be fun!

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.330
No, it absolutely will not be fun!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.430
No way in hell it'll be fun!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.230
Are you Hino-san?

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:18.210
Yeah.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.950
I'm Hoshino Hana, the star-nosed mole.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.550
Oh, you're my new roommate? 
Nice to meet you.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.890
Okay, I'm going to take her back to my room.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.340
See you guys later.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:36.260
So, um, the human mating season 
lasts all year, right?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.190
Huh?!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.650
Well, um... I'm not really sure...

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.260
I mean, uh...

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.980
I wonder who's gonna be 
staying in your room, Jin!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.070
Don't care.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.030
No matter what kind of animal it is,

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.290
I'll make them regret barging into my room!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.090
Wow, sounds like fun!

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:55.940
Is his roommate gonna be okay?

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.460
I think everything will be fine,

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.540
but let's go check in later.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.680
Welcome to the student council room.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:13.560
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.950
This is my room!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.980
How did you get in here, you pervert?!

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.560
Pervert?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.530
Hey! You're being rude to the president!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:17.980
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:17.980
What part of her is perverted?!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.520
She's exactly what she looks like!

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:23.830
I understand that you people 
don't think the same way we do,

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:29.620
but from our point of view, 
you couldn't be more indecent.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:33.250
And? What is the student 
council president doing here?

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:40.500
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.090
Didn't you hear the announcement in homeroom?

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:38.160
The underground dorms are flooded.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:40.500
Wait, are you the one I have 
to share my room with?!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.850
Don't you dare try anything funny!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:44.880
Like hell I'd do that!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:49.760
Mazama Jin-kun, there's something 
I'd like to ask you.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.430
Do you...

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:54.140
have any interest in being 
student council president?

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.070
Huh?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.600
What even gave you that idea?

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.040
As I told you before,

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:02.690
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.690
I've been observing all of you.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.320
During Field Day and the seaside school session,

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.830
you worked together across 
species boundaries.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.950
You let a panda join the cooking club,

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:13.580
and had a student from this school 
join a pack from another school.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.290
Everything you do disrupts the 
moral code and the ecosystem.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.460
But the mood at this school 
is brighter than it was before.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:25.650
I always thought forbidding different 
species from interfering with each other

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:30.090
would create an environment in which 
students could learn in safety,

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.990
but perhaps what the students want 
is the very thing you're doing.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.350
Me? The student council president?

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:43.860
Morning, Hitomi-chan!

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:47.590
Oh, good morning, Jin-kun!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.780
You look as beautiful as ever today.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.150
Since no one's around, I thought 
we had a day off today.

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.120
Not at all, Hitomi-chan.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.410
I used my authority as student council president

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.860
to return the animals to the wild.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.000
Now it's just...

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.250
you and me, Hitomi-chan.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.630
That's wonderful!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.590
Oh, look.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.110
A little puppy.

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.930
How did it get in here?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.680
Gurrrrgle

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.180
I think it's hungry.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.890
Oh, very well.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.270
Here.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:25.250
You can have this, so go back to the forest.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.940
Jin-kun! You're so nice! I love you!

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:32.180
Don't worry.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.860
I won't let any animals near this school.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.890
This is Seton Academy, a paradise 
for just the two of us!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.580
Seton Academy: Join the Pack!            The End

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:43.580
No, no! Wait just a minute!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.690
What was that? What happened 
to interspecies relations?

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:48.940
I don't need 'em.

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:49.510
What?!

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.820
Banishing all the students?

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.130
Don't use the dignified 
position of student council

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.470
president for personal gain!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:59.540
Even if it's in your biology, 
anyone who goes around naked in public

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.310
when it's the globally 
accepted norm to wear clothes

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.940
has no right to talk about dignity!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.310
But when I'm in front of the students, I...

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.220
I'm a student of this school, too.

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:12.200
Does the student council president 
discriminate against certain students?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.210
That's enough out of you!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:17.100
No, he's right.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:17.620
Huh?!

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.740
If I...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.000
If I just wear clothes...

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.000
P-President!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.010
<b>* She's Putting on Clothes</b>

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.670
President!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:36.180
<b>*
 
