s</b>

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.050
Quit dawdling! Hurry it up!

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.770
You brute!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.570
Are you satisfied now?

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.690
Not really.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:55.610
You brute!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:58.810
It seems I was a fool for 
putting my trust in you!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:02.120
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:01.550
Forget I ever mentioned making 
you student council president!

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:06.620
Wha...

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:10.350
What the hell is this?!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.590
What happened to all of you?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.530
There's the president!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:18.300
So the student council room really is here!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.150
This is <i>my</i> room!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.620
We never see you, so we wanted to talk to you.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.980
President, we have a problem.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.450
They're all here to rely on you!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.860
They need you, President!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:30.980
Me?

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.860
But I...

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.450
I told you, this is <i>my</i> room!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.560
Go back to the wild, you damn animals!

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:39.940
Be quiet!

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:40.910
I don't want to hear it!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.790
Stop fighting!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.460
Just stay calm.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:48.960
I'll listen to what all of you have to say!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.320
We'll start with you. Right this way.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.700
Hey! Don't just take over my room!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.300
<b>Temporary</b>

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.720
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.720
<b>Temporary</b>

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.090
I just said, don't—

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.090
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:58.090
<b>Temporary</b>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.850
Thank goodness. She's finally 
acting like herself again.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.310
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:13.860
<b>Temporary</b>

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:13.860
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.550
Thanks a lot!

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.120
<b>Temporary</b>

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.120
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.990
Excellent work!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.310
That was the last student.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.370
I'm sorry to cause so much trouble,

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.650
but it gave me a chance to 
talk to many of the students.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:32.750
Still...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:37.050
I just can't agree that interspecies 
relations are right.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:41.890
Will they all still need me, despite how I feel?

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.810
Why ask that after all this?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.470
What do you mean?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:53.190
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:50.260
You spoke to every single one 
of those animals individually.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:54.750
Who's the one engaging in 
the most interspecies relations?

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.020
<i>Me? Interspecies relations?</i>

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.570
<i>My desire to be helpful to everyone</i>

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.080
<i>was my own form of interspecies relations...</i>

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:12.290
<i>I felt I was being left behind as 
everyone else changed by the day,</i>

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.790
<i>but I can still...</i>

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:17.260
<i>continue to be everyone's 
student council president!</i>

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.300
Excuse me!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.170
Why are you stripping, 
you pervert?! Put your clothes on!

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:22.680
Eek! What are you doing?!

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.930
Jin, is everything okay?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.030
Stop it!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.170
What's your roomie like?

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:30.550
No! Stop!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.820
Jin-kun...

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.820
Jin...

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:29.820
Jin-san...

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.410
Wait, no! Hino-san, this is, um...

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.940
No! You pervert!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:37.440
I didn't do anything!

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.190
<b>Student Council Room
 (Temp.)</b>

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:43.200
I'm sorry for causing such a commotion.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:46.630
No, we're sorry for jumping to conclusions.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:48.910
Jin would never do something 
like that, right?

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:53.110
If you want to take off 
your clothes, you can. It's okay.

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.010
Then... I'll take you up on that.

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:00.090
But... if possible...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:04.090
I-I'd like to ask a favor of you...

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.850
<b>Student Council Room
 (Temp.)</b>

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.850
<b>Student Council Room
 (Temp.)</b>

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.850
<b>No Boys Allowed</b>

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.850
Is this okay?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.270
Yes, you're all very wholesome! Wonderful!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.380
We're allowed! Nudity is 
acceptable to naked mole rats!

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.320
<b>By General Standards</b>

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.320
<b>Unacceptable</b>

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:23.240
<i>Glance...</i>

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.160
<i>Glance...</i>

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.410
<b>Flat...</b>

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.160
Ranka, you're over here.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.930
What do you all think?

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.550
I don't know how to answer that...

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:52.860
<i>There's... a human here!</i>

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.480
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.480
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:26.820
Mom, Dad...

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:29.330
This is who I told you about.

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:31.070
I am Shishino King.

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:32.820
He's a lion...

00:22:32.820 --> 00:22:36.450
Um, he's not an impala, 
is he? He's a lion, right?

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:38.460
I have thrown away my lionhood!

00:22:39.590 --> 00:22:43.650
<i>When impalas sense danger, 
they run away by leaping.</i>

00:22:43.650 --> 00:22:46.350
Kin-kun! Don't start shouting out of nowhere!

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:48.880
S-Sorry. I was just nervous...

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:51.890
<i>Our daughter is slapping a lion?</i>

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:56.170
B-But... when you say you've 
thrown away your lionhood,

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:57.810
do you really mean it?

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.470
Yeah, he really does, Dad.

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:04.650
Kin-kun even cut off his precious mane for me.

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:07.910
And he's saved me lots of times.

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:10.910
Very well.

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.940
We will trust you.

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:17.910
But only on one condition.

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:19.290
You must...

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:21.920
take part in the impala tournament!

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.710
I shall!

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:24.920
<b>To Be Continued!</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.480
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:26.300
<b>Miki here. This school's morality is in shambles!</b>

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:27.820
<b>Especially around the cooking club!</b>

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:29.130
<b>This... is... Miyubi......</b>

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:30.780
<b>Miyubi-san! We only have ten seconds left!</b>

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.010
<b>Oh, I'm sorry......</b>

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.220
<b>(16x Speed) 
Next time,</b>

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:34.470
<b>(16x Speed) 
Jin-san's heart races when something changes in Ranka-chan!</b>

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:36.180
<b>(16x Speed) 
Hitomi-san is thrilled to make a human friend!</b>

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:37.180
<b>(16x Speed) 
It's a school romantic comedy arc where love and friendship blossom!</b>

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:37.830
<b>That was fast!</b>

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:38.950
<b>Also, that wasn't the preview!</b>

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 10</b>

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>A Gentle Savage</b>
